    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are delighted to present this well appointed 2 bedroom, first floor apartment to the market, ideally located in the popular Broadmeadow Castle development in the heart of Ashbourne.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a bright and spacious kitchen/dining area, a comfortable living room access to balcony, two generously sized bedrooms, and a main bathroom offering the perfect blend of comfort and convenience for first time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\n\nSuperbly positioned just moments from Ashbourne Town Centre, the property is within walking distance of a wide array of local amenities including shops, bars, restaurants, schools, crches, gyms, parks, and sporting facilities.\n\nIt is exceptionally well serviced by public transport, with both Ashbourne Connect and Bus ireann stops just a 2 minute stroll away providing direct links to Dublin City Centre and Dublin Airport. The N2 and M50 motorways, along with Dublin Airport, are also easily accessible by car.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended don`t miss out on this fantastic opportunity!\n\nEntrance Hallway - 2.72m (8'11) x 1.02m (3'4)\nSemi solid wood floor, ceiling coving.\n\nLounge - 4.71m (15'5) x 3.22m (10'7)\nSemi solid wood floor, ceiling coving, door to balcony.\n\nKitchen - 5.53m (18'2) x 2.34m (7'8)\nRange of floor eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback. Integrated single oven, electric hob extractor fan. Plumbed for washing machine. Semi solid wood floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.39m (11'1) x 2.75m (9'0)\nTo front of house with carpet floor built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.97m (9'9) x 2.4m (7'10)\nTo rear of house with semi solid wood floor built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.32m (7'7) x 1.67m (5'6)\nFully tiled with w.c., w.h.b., bath with power shower attachment shower screen. Heated towel rail.\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2 bedroom / 1 bathroom first floor apartment\nConstructed in 2001\nGated community\nTwo communal car spaces\nLocated on the first floor\nLocated in the heart of Ashbourne\nManagement Fee c. €1600"
